    <abstract pn="section-abstract">
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-1">This document describes the use of the ChaCha stream cipher and
Poly1305 authenticator in the Transport Layer Security (TLS) and
Datagram Transport Layer Security (DTLS) protocols.</t>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-abstract-2">This document updates RFCs 5246 and 6347.</t>
    </abstract>
